7	/**
8	 * Class-level constraint enforcing the cross-field postcode rule: a supplied postcode must be valid
9	 * for the owner's city. The check needs both {@code city} and {@code postcode}, so it is applied to
10	 * the whole owner payload rather than a single field. A {@code null} postcode is accepted (the
11	 * field is optional) and 4-digit formatting is enforced separately by {@code @Pattern}; this
12	 * constraint only rejects a well-formed postcode that is out of range for the city's known region.
13	 */
