### Ordering summary (entry point → persist)
1. `@Valid` on request body → Bean Validation of `OwnerFieldsDto` (field constraints + `@PostcodeValidation`, `@AddressValidation`, `@TelephoneValidation`); failures → 400 via advice.
2. `@PreAuthorize("hasRole(@roles.OWNER_ADMIN)")` on controller method.
3. `ownerMapper.toOwner(dto)` — normalizes address/phone/email, ignores id/pets.
4. `clinicService.saveOwner` (`@Transactional`): default registration date + business-day roll → household resolution (**saves other owners**) → identityKey duplicate check (409) → city limit (409) → daily limit (429) → customerCode → namesakeCount + bulkSignupWarning → membershipNumber → `ownerRepository.save` → `AUDIT.info`.
5. `ownerMapper.toOwnerDto` → 201 Created with `Location` header.

No entity lifecycle callbacks, no events, no email, no password encoding, no caching.
